      (''window_size'', ''4'')], [(''ack_in'', ''message'', 1), (''in'', ''message'',
      1)], [(''feedback'', ''message'', 1), (''out'', ''message'', 1)], ''\nCustom
      block: QT GUI Message Entry -> PDU sender with Go-Back-N ARQ.\n- Splits text
